# Q-Quest Complete Restructure — 6-Qubit Simulator

## Overview

Restructure from single-qubit to 6-qubit quantum simulator with 64-dimensional state vector, tensor product math engine, drag-and-drop circuit board, and full linear algebra visualization.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a **complete replacement** of all existing `src/` files. The 1-qubit implementation will be fully overwritten.

> [!WARNING]
> The `MathPanel.jsx` component needs `formatComplex()` for displaying gate matrices. The architecture rule forbids engine imports in components. Plan: inline a small display-only formatter in `LinearAlgebraPanel.jsx` (~10 lines). This is display logic, not math logic.

