## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```
npm run build
```
- Zero build errors
- Zero missing imports
- All architecture boundaries enforced

### Runtime Verification (browser)
1. Apply H to q[0] → probabilities split 50/50 on |000000⟩ and |000001⟩
2. Apply CNOT(control=0, target=1) → Bell state |00⟩+|11⟩ on q[0],q[1]
3. Mini Bloch spheres show mixed state (purity < 1) for entangled qubits
4. Undo removes last gate, state reverts correctly
5. Reset clears all gates, returns to |000000⟩
6. Drag-and-drop places gates on circuit wires
7. Click gate chip on wire to remove it
